        {
          "text": ", inside. All three stay in the frame, and the count holds at eighteen — three positions change here, not one."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Across all five windows, the G form is the "
        },
        {
          "text": "only",
          "marks": ["bold"]
        },
        {
          "text": " one where every "
        },
        {
          "text": "b6",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " raises to a "
        },
        {
          "text": "6",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " without leaving the picture — the other four each lose at least one dot off the top. Raising a degree always pushes its dot toward a window's top edge and never the bottom; "
        },
        {
          "text": "Lydian in a Window You Already Own",
          "link": {
            "kind": "article",
            "slug": "modes-lydian-neck"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " already showed why. That's why this move belongs here — nothing about the diagram is doing anything clever, so your attention can go entirely to the sound."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "items": [
        [
          {
            "text": "Start a held root: press the drone bar on any scale card earlier in this chapter, or open "
          },
          {
            "text": "Drone",
            "link": {
              "kind": "screen",
              "href": "/drone"
            }
          },
          {
            "text": " and set it to "
          },
          {
            "text": "A",
            "marks": ["code"]
          },
          {
            "text": ". Leave it running — it keeps sounding while you play."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "Fret "
          },
          {
            "text": "4·3",
            "marks": ["code"]
          },
          {
            "text": ", the "
          },
          {
            "text": "b6",
            "marks": ["code"]
          },
          {
            "text": ", and let it ring against the held "
          },
          {
            "text": "A",
            "marks": ["code"]
          },
          {
            "text": ". That's the ache."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "Move that finger one fret up, to "
          },
          {
            "text": "4·4",
            "marks": ["code"]
          },
          {
            "text": ". Same finger, same string. Listen to what just happened underneath it."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "Do the same with "
          },
          {
            "text": "6·1",
            "marks": ["code"]
          },
          {
            "text": " to "
          },
          {
            "text": "6·2",
            "marks": ["code"]
          },
          {
            "text": ", and "
          },
          {
            "text": "1·1",
            "marks": ["code"]
          },
          {
            "text": " to "
          },
          {
            "text": "1·2",
            "marks": ["code"]
          },
          {
            "text": ". Three places, one move."
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "text": "Then play the whole window down and back with the drone still going, taking the raised sixth every time."
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The A form, frets 0 to 3, shows what happens when one of the three has nowhere to go. "
        },
        {
          "text": "A Natural minor",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": "'s "
        },
        {
          "text": "b6",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " sits at "
        },
        {
          "text": "6·1",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": ", "
        },
        {
          "text": "4·3",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " and "
        },
        {
          "text": "1·1",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " here too; "
        },
        {
          "text": "A Dorian",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": "'s "
        },
        {
          "text": "6",
          "marks": [
            "code",
            {
              "type": "color",
              "tone": "amber"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " sits at only "
        },
        {
          "text": "6·2",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " and "
        },
        {
          "text": "1·2",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": ". "
        },
        {
          "text": "6·1",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " and "
        },
        {
          "text": "1·1",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " step up inside as before. But "
        },
        {
          "text": "4·3",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " sits on the window's top fret — raising it sends it straight out of the picture, and nothing can step in from below because there's no fret −1. Seventeen becomes sixteen. "
        },
        {
          "text": "Mixolydian, and What the Window's Edges Do",
          "link": {
            "kind": "article",
            "slug": "modes-mixolydian-neck"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " watched the same mechanism cost a dot in the major family; it's the identical trap one family down."
        }
      ]
